      "/": {
        "comment_0": "tapeout_chain: 2 x tt_um_stereo_slice, the Tiny Tapeout module (asic/tt). 16 disparities per slice; chain_hub_0 broadcasts the census signatures (dl), the result travels from slice to slice (uo_out -> uio_in) and back to the hub (ul)."
